==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Kyuubei]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Kyuubei]]s spawn, delay 4~6.67 seconds<sup>120f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your main concern is this stage is the Shy Boy. You can easily beat him by doing the usual stacking ranged units and meatshielding.

